{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic\/Content-swift.enum"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLHarmonicV7ContentO7naturalyA2EmF","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"title":"MXLHarmonic.Content.natural","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"natural","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"case","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Case"},"abstract":[{"text":"The natural element indicates that this is a natural harmonic. These are usually notated at base pitch rather","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than sounding pitch.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic\/Content-swift.enum\/natural","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"natural","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlharmonic\/content-swift.enum\/natural"]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLHarmonic/Content-swift.enum/natural":{"abstract":[{"text":"The natural element indicates that this is a natural harmonic. These are usually notated at base pitch rather","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than sounding pitch.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLHarmonic.Content.natural","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic\/Content-swift.enum\/natural","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlharmonic\/content-swift.enum\/natural","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"natural","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Ivor